        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: பந்தயம்",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பந்தயம் — pantayam — \"a race; a bet\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "நூறு மீட்டர் பந்தயத்தில் அவன் முதலில் வந்தான். nūṟu mīṭṭar pantayattil avaṉ mutalil vantāṉ. He came first in the hundred-metre race."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Both \"a race\" and \"a bet\": பந்தயம் (pantayam) கட்டு, to place a bet."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "DEDR 3921 gives பந்தயம் (pantayam), \"a contest for a prize, a wager\", with cognates across the south, and reports a proposal to derive the group from Sanskrit paṇita, \"a wager\"; the origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
